<title>USA: Polymeric exploring alternatives.</title>
<headline>Polymeric exploring alternatives.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, N.J. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polymeric Resources Corp said on Friday that directors authorized managment to explore alternatives available, including recapitalization or a business combination.</p>
<p>The company said the investment banking firm of TM Capital Corp has been retained as Polymeric's financial advisor.</p>
<p>The company is a pioneer in the recycling of thermoplastics that regenerates, compounds and produces plastic intermediates for the manufacture of a wide array of injection molded and extruded plastic products.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
